.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Enums available globally in the csmp Namespace
.SH "Enumeration Type Documentation"
.PP 
.SS "enum class \fBcsmp::ManifoldType\fP : int8_t\fR [strong]\fP"

.PP
\fBNote\fP
.RS 4
This classification is for NodeManifolds (topologically collocated Nodes) only)! 

.PP
Not all of these classifiers apply to manifolds, like endpoint 

.PP
NodeManifolds exist only at \fBSplitBoundary\fP objects 

.PP
\fBSplitBoundary\fP objects exist only inside of models 

.PP
since SplitBoundaries are surfaces, this is the highest dimension 

.PP
Classification applies to all nodes within Manifold simultaneously (including intervening ones) 
.RE
.PP

.PP
